OL,3,AEmma Barnett to leave Radio 4's Today
OL,4,Afor new BBC show
OL,5,
OL,6,FRadio 4 presenter Emma Barnett is set
OL,7,Fto leave the Today programme this week
OL,8,Ffor a multiplatform new BBC show in the
OL,9,FNew Year.
OL,11,FFormer Woman's Hour host Barnett has
OL,12,Fdeveloped a "bold" new show, she says,
OL,13,Fwhich will launch in 2027 across BBC
OL,14,FSounds, BBC iPlayer and YouTube.
OL,16,FHer final day presenting Radio 4's
OL,17,Fflagship morning news and current
OL,18,Faffairs show will be on Wednesday 18
OL,19,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
