OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEmma Barnett to leave Radio 4's Today
OL,4,Afor new BBC show
OL,5,
OL,6,F"For the last nearly six years - it's
OL,7,Fbeen incredible to talk to the mighty
OL,8,FRadio 4 listeners," she said in a
OL,9,Fstatement. "Having proudly hosted
OL,10,FWoman's Hour and now the Today
OL,11,FProgramme - I've had the rare pleasure
OL,12,Fof hosting nearly every hour of the
OL,13,Fmorning on this truly unique and
OL,14,Fspecial radio network."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
